.TH WELLPCI 1 "August 2026" "wellpci 2.0" "wellutils"
.SH NAME
Wellpci \- L i s t s   P C I   d e v i c e s   w i t h   c l a s s   d e s c r i p t i o n s   f r o m   t h e   h w d a t a   p c i . i d s
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wellpci
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wellpci
.PP
Lists PCI devices with class descriptions from the hwdata pci.ids
database, grouped by bus.
.PP
When stdout is a terminal the output is drawn as a box; when piped a plain layout is used.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-lang " ru|en|auto"
Force report language (default \fBauto\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-color " always|never|auto"
Force, disable, or auto-detect ANSI colour.
.TP
.B \-\-plain
Plain text output without box drawing.
.TP
.B \-\-box
Force box drawing even when piped.
.TP
.B \-\-no-emoji
Disable emoji icons.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable verbose tracing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command-line usage.
.TP
.B 3
Unexpected runtime error.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WELLUTILS_LANG
\fBru\fR or \fBen\fR; overrides locale detection.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disables colour in auto mode.
.SH AUTHOR
wellbou_
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wellutils (1)
